# Trust anchor for owner-signed merge queues (scripts/ops/merge_queue_driver.ps1).
# Format: OpenSSH allowed_signers. Only the repository owner adds a line here, in a change the
# owner authors and instructs to merge; an agent never adds, edits or "fixes" a key. While this
# file has no key line every queue is refused as unsigned, in dry and live mode alike.
# Owner line shape (one line, the owner's own public key):
# owner namespaces="weather-merge-queue" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
# Procedure: docs/operations/INTEGRATION_ATTEMPT_RUNBOOK.md, "Merge-train dry pilot".
